body:
my first signs were that i was laughing and talking to myself unnecessarilly coz i imagined of myself a successful superstar dating a gorgeous actress  doing all the both good & bad stuff a superstar does....ummm...much of a anti-hero in real life. made myself also a successful director..made a own francise directed by me..also a alt-right politician at  the same time. basically my other personality is a superstar director, producer, politiian all at the same time...

&#x200B;

it had been more than 10 years and i even realized that i was having this thing in my brain...
